{"n":109,"ar":"الكافرون","tr":"Al-Kafirun","en":"The Disbelievers","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"قُلۡ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ","Qul ya ayyuha alkafiroona","Say: O disbelievers"],[2,"لَآ أَعۡبُدُ مَا تَعۡبُدُونَ","La aAAbudu ma taAAbudoona","I worship not that which ye worship"],[3,"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","Nor worship ye that which I worship"],[4,"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٞ مَّا عَبَدتُّمۡ","Wala ana AAabidun ma AAabadtum","And I shall not worship that which ye worship"],[5,"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","Nor will ye worship that which I worship"],[6,"لَكُمۡ دِينُكُمۡ وَلِيَ دِينِ","Lakum deenukum waliya deeni","Unto you your religion, and unto me my religion"]]}